gabrielle union was devastated and  broken into pieces after learning that  her now husband dwyane wade had a baby  with another woman for the first time  ever the actress speaks out about the  life-changing moment in her new memoir  you got anything stronger love wasn't  some guy riding up on a white horse and  you know you live in a castle and it's  happily ever after gabrielle recalls  quote in 2013 before we were married  dwayne had a baby with another woman it  should go without saying that we were  not in a good place in our relationship  at the time that child was conceived but  we were in a much better place when he  finally told me about the pregnancy i  have not had words and even after untold  amounts of therapy i am not sure i have  them now but truth matters the actress  and the former basketball player began  dating in 2008. the athlete fathered now  seven-year-old xavier in 2013 when he  and gabrielle were on a break when  dwayne broke the news to her they were  trying for their own child she wrote the  experience of dwayne having a baby so  easily while i was unable to left my  soul not just broken into pieces but  shattered into fine dust scattering in  the wind with desperate hands we  gathered what we could to slowly remake  me into something new gabrielle hit rock  bottom while going through a couple  miscarriages saying she remembered  thinking  this woman is such a failure and she has  the nerve to be old and she has the  nerve to have a younger husband and she  has the nerve to stick with a guy who  had a kid with somebody else she  admitted that her feelings weren't  originating from a healthy place during  that time what happens in your family  shapes so much of how you see the world  the decisions you make on the people you  allow in your life  you know how you interact with other  people amid her rocky road to motherhood  she recalled the former miami heat  player telling her as much as we want  this baby i want you we've lost too much  in our relationship for me to be okay  with encouraging you to do one more  thing to your body and your soul he  motivates me he has like every day i  feel like i wake up and he's got a new  deal on the table so it makes me go okay  let's keep working let's keep striving  um you know i married a guy almost 10  years younger than me and i i assumed i  would be the teacher and here i am the  people learning um you know and being  motivated by by his work ethic but  despite the unconditional love from her  partner gabrielle wasn't certain they  would make it through the dark time  writing so much of what made the  decision so difficult was that if i  didn't submit to surrogacy then i was  convinced i needed to let dwayne go  even if he didn't want to i had to let  him find someone who could give him what  he wanted but i loved him ultimately she  chose love and surrogacy welcoming the  couple's daughter kavia in november  2016. she added each day he had work to  be forgiven and i had chosen to love him  and forgive him and part of this journey  of making peace with our love is also  making peace with ourselves i've learned  to open keeping my mind open keep my  eyes open keep my heart open and keep my  thoughts open and that's what i've been  trying to do is i'm grown into  the man that i've always dreamed of  becoming the actress noted the pair's  relationship struggles made them  stronger writing he wouldn't have become  the man he desperately wanted to be and  i would not become the woman i dreamed  of being but admits the me of today  would not have stayed with him  [Music]  the couple meanwhile celebrated their  seven-year wedding anniversary last  month and although dwayne and gabrielle  went through tough times they came out  on top together  [Music]  you
 

